data: {"id": "e741ba3fb1ae47e6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1478", "run_id": "e741ba3fb1ae47e6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经采集到全部关键证据。让我整理结论。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|------|---------|\n| **Kubernetes 状态** | Pod 当前 Running，但 container `app` 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，重启计数 21 次 |\n| **Last State** | Terminated，Exit Code=78，Reason=Error |\n| **Container Command** | `python3 -u -c import os, sys; value = os.getenv('APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG'); print('APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing' if value is None else 'configuration loaded', flush=True); sys.exit(78 if value is None else 0)` |\n| **Environment** | `<none>` —", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789144966295, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

