data: {"id": "e741ba3fb1ae47e6-final", "run_id": "e741ba3fb1ae47e6", "seq": 1483, "ts_ms": 1789144980930, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v10/workload 的容器配置中缺失必需环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG，导致应用启动时读取到空值并执行 sys.exit(78) 主动退出。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CrashLoopBackOff` (app) | 确认 Pod 当前处于重启背退的异常生命周期 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: `78` (app) | 提供进程退出的具体代码，指向应用层主动终止 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff restarting failed container app` (kubelet, x375) | 记录 Kubelet 检测到频繁重启的行为及频次 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` | 直接记录应用启动失败的具体原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` (reason=Error, value=1) | 独立于 K8s 事件观测到容器因 Error 终止的状态 |\n\n应用日志明确指出了缺失 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量，K8s 状态显示容器以此退出，随后由 Kubelet 触发 `CrashLoopBackOff`，三者在因果逻辑上完全自洽。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器配置缺失环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG → 应用启动时读取空值并执行 sys.exit(78) → 进程非正常退出触发重启策略 → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因确认为 Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` 的配置中缺失必需的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`。应用启动逻辑检测到该关键变量缺失后，主动执行 `sys.exit(78)` 终止进程（证据 #2），Kubelet 捕获到非零退出码并判定容器失败，进而启动重启机制，最终导致 Pod 陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 #1、#3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 30.9s (Evidence 23.1s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.067, "metrics": {"run_id": "e741ba3fb1ae47e6", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.05793476104736, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62057.93476104736, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 59334.48386192322, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6895.041465759277, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2407.3777198791504}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24355.147123336792, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 30945.44005393982, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6728.1951904296875